#: code:addons/l10n_bg_fiscal_printer_datecs_pm/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"Datecs PM direct-print of invoices is on the Phase 2 roadmap. Until then, "
"use l10n_bg_erp_net_fp for back-office invoice printing or wait for cmd "
"0x39 (invoice data) to land in the high-level facade."
msgstr ""
"Директният печат на фактури през Datecs PM е в Phase 2 roadmap. Засега "
"използвай l10n_bg_erp_net_fp за back-office фактуриране или изчакай "
"имплементацията на команда 0x39 (invoice data) във high-level facade-а."
